# Token claim sets for the opa-id-roles identity case (same as cel-id-roles).
# Presence of this file marks the case as an IDENTITY case: suite.sh mints one
# token per key via the mock's POST /generate (body = the JSON below), attaches
# it as `Authorization: Bearer`, and fires GET /toys.
# Only custom claims are set (roles); iss/aud/sub come from the mock's env so
# there are no duplicate keys.
# Format: <token-key> <claims-json>
admin {"roles":["admin"]}
guest {"roles":["guest"]}
